# Preset documents and their manifests (docs/design/mode-compiler.md §6.4, §8.3): canonical
# JSON is LF by definition and `bspc roundtrip --expect MANIFEST` compares MANIFEST's text, so
# no checkout may convert them (Git for Windows checks text out as CRLF under core.autocrlf).
# tools/ci/bspc_roundtrip.py checks these rules on every leg. compiler/tests/data keeps its own.
/dsp/tests/golden/presets/**/*.json text eol=lf
/dsp/tests/golden/presets/MANIFEST text eol=lf
/firmware/factory/**/*.json text eol=lf
/firmware/factory/MANIFEST text eol=lf
# Packages are bytes: never converted, never diffed as text.
*.bsp binary
